From 22ccff377e5e5aec132331fb3f8fbcf14127e642 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] miner: overhaul BlockAssembler to O(1) Merklix overlay
 assembly

Update BlockAssembler::CreateNewBlock to snapshot the speculative
mempool Merklix overlay in O(1), combine coinbase commitments with
Subtree A, and populate the 134-byte V2 block header roots directly.
---
 src/test/lotus_v2_tests.cpp | 131 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/test/miner_tests.cpp    | 129 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 260 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/test/lotus_v2_tests.cpp

diff --git a/src/test/lotus_v2_tests.cpp b/src/test/lotus_v2_tests.cpp
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..00c5749005
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/test/lotus_v2_tests.cpp
@@ -0,0 +1,131 @@
